// Ch9 B01, bark 1 (optional): Old Marra, at the end of the Stillguard row, to a child sitting beside a
// shroud. The game's only explanation of the all-clear before the Ending's E3, where Kerrid finally
// says it. It names the living captain, Hobb, and says nothing of 1001 (Ch8 rule 3). Field bark.
title: ch09_bark_marra
location: ch09/corrow_night
---
Marra [tender]: When the last one's up, the captain calls it. "Stair's clear." That's how you know you can come off the wall. #line:ch09_bark_marra_001
Child [neutral]: Did he call it? #line:ch09_bark_marra_002
Marra [sad]: Hobb? No. You don't. Not while there's anyone below. #line:ch09_bark_marra_003
